00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.399
HIGHLY ANTICIPATED MEETING

00:00:59.097 --> 00:01:02.434
BETWEEN KIM JONG UN AND MYSELF

00:01:00.532 --> 00:01:03.835
WILL TAKE PLACE IN SINGAPORE ON

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:05.637
