00:01:03.969 --> 00:01:07.239
MAKE IT A VERY SPECIAL MOMENT

00:01:05.771 --> 00:01:09.841
FOR WORLD PEACE.

00:01:07.372 --> 00:01:12.144
THE DATE CARRIES HISTORIC

00:01:09.975 --> 00:01:13.478
SIGNIFICANCE BRIDGE JUNE 12TH

00:01:12.277 --> 00:01:15.213
1987 THAT RONALD REAGAN GAVE A

00:01:13.612 --> 00:01:17.416
SPEECH IN WEST GERMANY.

00:01:15.347 --> 00:01:19.084
A SPEECH THAT SET THE STAGE FOR

00:01:17.549 --> 00:01:22.788
THE FALL OF THE SOVIET UNION.

00:01:19.217 --> 00:01:24.189
&gt;&gt; MR. GORBACHEV TEAR DOWN THIS

00:01:22.921 --> 00:01:26.291
WALL.

00:01:24.323 --> 00:01:28.226
&gt;&gt; WHITE HOUSE OFFICIALS SAY THE

00:01:26.425 --> 00:01:28.627
CHOICE OF JUNE 12TH WAS SIMPLY A

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:33.231
COINCIDENCE.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:33.965
BUT AS PRESIDENT REAGAN FOUND,

00:01:33.365 --> 00:01:35.734
PRESIDENT TRUMP BELIEVES THAT

00:01:34.099 --> 00:01:36.401
KIM JONG UN WILL WANT TO CHOOSE

00:01:35.867 --> 00:01:38.070
