00:01:38.937 --> 00:01:43.809
I THINK THAT HE DID THIS BECAUSE

00:01:41.573 --> 00:01:44.876
HE REALLY WANTS TO DO SOMETHING,

00:01:43.942 --> 00:01:46.812
AND BRING THE COUNTRY INTO THE

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:49.014
