00:01:46.945 --> 00:01:51.049
&gt;&gt; IN AN EFFORT TO KEEP HIM

00:01:49.147 --> 00:01:53.085
MOVING TOWARDS THE BARGAINING

00:01:51.183 --> 00:01:55.053
TABLE, DROPPING THE HARSH

00:01:53.218 --> 00:01:56.588
RHETORIC OF LITTLE ROCKET MAN,

00:01:55.187 --> 00:01:59.191
GOING SO FAR TO PRAISE HIM FOR

00:01:56.722 --> 00:02:01.927
RELEASING THE DETAINEES.

00:01:59.358 --> 00:02:07.399
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO THANK KIM JONG UN

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:09.034
WHO REALLY WAS EXCELLENT TO WITH

00:02:07.532 --> 00:02:12.137
