00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:12.804
&gt;&gt; THE COMPLEMENT BROUGHT SHARP

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.271
CRITICISM FROM THE SENATE

00:02:12.938 --> 00:02:14.840
MINORITY LEADER.

00:02:13.405 --> 00:02:17.142
&gt;&gt; THE EXULTATION OF THE

00:02:14.973 --> 00:02:19.811
GREATNESS OF NORTH KOREA DOING

00:02:17.275 --> 00:02:22.013
THIS EVADES ME.

00:02:19.945 --> 00:02:25.417
WE CANNOT BE FOOLED INTO GIVING

00:02:22.147 --> 00:02:26.618
THE NORTH KOREAN REGIME CREDIT.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:28.053
FOR RETURNING AMERICANS THAT

00:02:26.752 --> 00:02:29.421
NEVER SHOULD HAVE BEEN DETAINED

00:02:28.186 --> 00:02:31.056
