00:02:29.554 --> 00:02:33.225
&gt;&gt; IN RESPONSE TO CHUCK SCHUMER,

00:02:31.189 --> 00:02:34.493
THE HOUSE SPEAKER SAID, GIVE THE

00:02:33.358 --> 00:02:37.229
PRESIDENT A BREAK.

00:02:34.626 --> 00:02:38.196
&gt;&gt; HE IS PREPARING FOR A SUMMIT

00:02:37.362 --> 00:02:45.437
WITH THE LEADER OF NORTH KOREA

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:48.240
TO FOCUS ON DENUCLEARIZATION.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:50.609
WE SHOULD GIVE HIM SOME LEEWAY.

00:02:48.373 --> 00:02:53.145
&gt;&gt; WHILE PRESIDENT TRUMP LIKED

00:02:50.742 --> 00:02:55.013
THE IDEA OF THE DMZ WHERE KIM

00:02:53.278 --> 00:02:55.814
AND SOUTH KOREA'S

00:02:55.147 --> 00:02:57.649
PRESIDENT MATZ, SINGAPORE WAS

00:02:55.947 --> 00:02:59.785
ALWAYS THE FIRST CHOICE OF THE.

00:02:57.783 --> 00:03:01.753
CLOSE ENOUGH FOR HIM TO GET TO

00:02:59.918 --> 00:03:06.391
WITH THE LIMITED FLEET OF

00:03:01.887 --> 00:03:07.692
AIRCRAFT AT THE NEUTRAL

00:03:06.525 --> 00:03:09.194
TERRITORY.

00:03:07.826 --> 00:03:09.628
A CITY RENOWNED FOR EXCELLENT

00:03:09.327 --> 00:03:13.131
SECURITY.

00:03:09.761 --> 00:03:16.234
&gt;&gt; JUST ABOUT TWO WEEKS BEFORE

