00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:20.639
CONFERENCE WHERE DELEGATES COME

00:03:18.136 --> 00:03:22.908
FROM ALL OVER THE INDO PACIFIC

00:03:20.772 --> 00:03:23.875
INCLUDING THE UNITED STATES TO

00:03:23.041 --> 00:03:24.176
TALK ABOUT MUTUAL SECURITY

00:03:24.009 --> 00:03:25.877
NEEDS.

00:03:24.309 --> 00:03:26.711
SO I THINK THAT IT MAKES A LOT

00:03:26.011 --> 00:03:30.182
OF SENSE.

00:03:26.845 --> 00:03:32.384
IT IS AN IDEAL LOCATION.

00:03:30.315 --> 00:03:33.418
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT TRUMP HAD HIS EYE

00:03:32.517 --> 00:03:35.787
