00:03:42.327 --> 00:03:44.763
THE PRESIDENT SAID THAT HE

00:03:44.129 --> 00:03:48.033
EXPECTS WHEN THE LANGUAGE OF THE

00:03:44.896 --> 00:03:49.100
BILL IS DRAFTED THAT IT WILL

00:03:48.166 --> 00:03:51.036
INCLUDE MEASURES THAT WOULD

00:03:49.234 --> 00:03:52.003
REQUIRE WORK FOR PEOPLE WHO ARE

00:03:51.169 --> 00:03:53.271
ON FOOD STAMPS.

00:03:52.137 --> 00:03:55.073
THE PRESIDENT SAID THAT HE

00:03:53.405 --> 00:03:56.942
EXPECTS SAID TO BE IN THE

00:03:55.207 --> 00:03:58.176
