00:03:57.075 --> 00:04:02.214
ISSUING WHAT WAS EXPECTED TO BE

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:04.115
A VETO TREND.

00:04:02.347 --> 00:04:06.017
&gt;&gt; Bret: THERE IS A STORY IN

00:04:04.249 --> 00:04:08.587
"THE NEW YORK TIMES" HEADLINED

00:04:06.151 --> 00:04:10.589
NORTH SECURITY CLOSE TO

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.791
RESIGNING AFTER TRUMP BERATED

00:04:10.722 --> 00:04:13.425
HER AND TALKS ABOUT AN INCIDENT,

00:04:12.924 --> 00:04:16.228
WHAT WE KNOW ABOUT THAT?

00:04:13.558 --> 00:04:18.630
&gt;&gt; WHAT WE DO KNOW IS THAT IN

00:04:16.361 --> 00:04:19.831
