00:04:40.785 --> 00:04:42.754
COMING SOON.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.023
THAT WOULD DENY THE EXISTENCE OF

00:04:42.888 --> 00:04:46.625
A RESIGNATION LETTER.

00:04:45.156 --> 00:04:48.093
IT MAY BE THAT SHE WAS SAYING

00:04:46.758 --> 00:04:49.794
SOMETHING TO THE EFFECT OF WELL,

00:04:48.226 --> 00:04:51.363
IF I'M NOT DOING A GOOD JOB,

00:04:49.928 --> 00:04:51.796
MAYBE I SHOULD NOT BE IN THIS

00:04:51.496 --> 00:04:53.632
JOB.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.399
BUT AS FAR AS DRAFTING A FORMAL

00:04:53.765 --> 00:04:56.902
